 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.54,
   "end": 1.92,
   "text": "Hello again, teachers."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.39,
   "end": 4.9,
   "text": "A good lesson plan takes about an hour to write."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.43,
   "end": 8.04,
   "text": "An AI can draft one in 30 seconds."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.38,
   "end": 10.92,
   "text": "but the draft is only as good as what you tell it."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.8,
   "end": 15.59,
   "text": "Ask for a lesson plan on fractions and you may get a three-day unit."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.28,
   "end": 16.93,
   "text": "with a projector."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.34,
   "end": 20.55,
   "text": "Tablets and revision of things your class never learned."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.56,
   "end": 22.85,
   "text": "So give it three things."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.32,
   "end": 25.09,
   "text": "the class and what they already know."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.46,
   "end": 26.53,
   "text": "the time you have."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.87,
   "end": 28.0,
   "text": "and what is in your room."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.41,
   "end": 31.04,
   "text": "Then you fix the draft because you are the teacher."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.96,
   "end": 35.94,
   "text": "Today's example is the first lesson on fractions for Class V."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.66,
   "end": 38.08,
   "text": "First,"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.36,
   "end": 40.45,
   "text": "say the class and what they already know."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.86,
   "end": 42.98,
   "text": "then the plan starts in the right place."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.83,
   "end": 46.53,
   "text": "The AI cannot tell what your students have learned."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.03,
   "end": 48.68,
   "text": "If you only say fractions,"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.98,
   "end": 51.56,
   "text": "It may assume they met fractions last year."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.93,
   "end": 55.04,
   "text": "It will start with revision of something that was never taught."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.9,
   "end": 57.12,
   "text": "Here is my first prompt."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.62,
   "end": 59.56,
   "text": "Write a lesson plan on fractions."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.99,
   "end": 61.51,
   "text": "The plan begins like this."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.85,
   "end": 62.28,
   "text": "Start"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.78,
   "end": 65.38,
   "text": "revise equivalent fractions from last year."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.78,
   "end": 68.13,
   "text": "My class 5 has never seen a fraction."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.5,
   "end": 69.76,
   "text": "so I add one line."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.17,
   "end": 72.68,
   "text": "It is class 5 first lesson on fraction."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.11,
   "end": 74.47,
   "text": "Now the plan begins."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.68,
   "end": 76.0,
   "text": "Fold a paper in half."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.38,
   "end": 77.41,
   "text": "This is one half."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.78,
   "end": 79.88,
   "text": "That is where a first lesson should begin."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.34,
   "end": 82.05,
   "text": "with something the children can hold."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.58,
   "end": 84.39,
   "text": "Notice the two parts of that line."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.86,
   "end": 86.56,
   "text": "Class 5 tells at the age."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.97,
   "end": 89.06,
   "text": "First lesson tells it the starting point."
  },
  {
   "start": 89.43,
   "end": 90.37,
   "text": "You need both."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.71,
   "end": 92.74,
   "text": "If your class is behind, say so."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.14,
   "end": 93.92,
   "text": "For example,"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.26,
   "end": 96.39,
   "text": "Most of them still find division hard."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.98,
   "end": 99.36,
   "text": "The plan will slow down and add practice."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.38,
   "end": 101.92,
   "text": "A common mistake is to write."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.33,
   "end": 104.23,
   "text": "Make it the best lesson plan ever!"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.6,
   "end": 106.82,
   "text": "Best ever tells the AI nothing new."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.16,
   "end": 108.9,
   "text": "It was already trying its best."
  },
  {
   "start": 109.24,
   "end": 110.85,
   "text": "Tell it about the children instead."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.08,
   "end": 114.21,
   "text": "and give it your time limit."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.55,
   "end": 117.12,
   "text": "Tell the AI exactly how long you have."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.98,
   "end": 119.65,
   "text": "and it cuts the plan to fit the bell."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.54,
   "end": 121.6,
   "text": "without a time limit."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.91,
   "end": 125.12,
   "text": "The AI plans for an ideal school with no bell."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.46,
   "end": 126.53,
   "text": "You get an introduction."
  },
  {
   "start": 126.78,
   "end": 128.52,
   "text": "three activities group work"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.98,
   "end": 130.53,
   "text": "a quiz and homework review."
  },
  {
   "start": 130.87,
   "end": 132.23,
   "text": "On paper it is lovely."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.54,
   "end": 134.95,
   "text": "In a real period, you would finish a third of it."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.83,
   "end": 137.12,
   "text": "Look at our fractions plan."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.56,
   "end": 138.72,
   "text": "At the top it says"
  },
  {
   "start": 138.97,
   "end": 139.49,
   "text": "length."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.86,
   "end": 141.83,
   "text": "a three-day unit with an assessment."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.2,
   "end": 143.27,
   "text": "I have one period."
  },
  {
   "start": 143.67,
   "end": 144.42,
   "text": "So I add"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.79,
   "end": 146.56,
   "text": "I have one 40 minute period."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.94,
   "end": 147.88,
   "text": "I send it again."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.31,
   "end": 149.19,
   "text": "Now it says..."
  },
  {
   "start": 149.46,
   "end": 149.89,
   "text": "length."
  },
  {
   "start": 150.14,
   "end": 152.48,
   "text": "140 minute period in four steps."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.86,
   "end": 155.33,
   "text": "Five minutes to start. 15 to teach."
  },
  {
   "start": 155.77,
   "end": 157.89,
   "text": "15 to practice, 5 to close."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.2,
   "end": 160.58,
   "text": "Every step has its minutes written next to it."
  },
  {
   "start": 160.92,
   "end": 163.72,
   "text": "That is a plan I can follow with a clock on the wall."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.09,
   "end": 165.89,
   "text": "If you lose time to attendance,"
  },
  {
   "start": 166.1,
   "end": 166.95,
   "text": "Tell it that too."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.32,
   "end": 167.84,
   "text": "I write."
  },
  {
   "start": 168.22,
   "end": 170.44,
   "text": "The first five minutes go to attendance."
  },
  {
   "start": 170.74,
   "end": 173.0,
   "text": "It then plans for 35 minutes."
  },
  {
   "start": 173.27,
   "end": 174.31,
   "text": "which is the truth."
  },
  {
   "start": 175.16,
   "end": 177.22,
   "text": "Ask for the minutes next to every step."
  },
  {
   "start": 177.72,
   "end": 178.05,
   "text": "then"
  },
  {
   "start": 178.39,
   "end": 179.81,
   "text": "when the class runs late."
  },
  {
   "start": 180.02,
   "end": 182.34,
   "text": "you can see at a glance which step to drop."
  },
  {
   "start": 184.12,
   "end": 185.92,
   "text": "Third, tell it what is in your room."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.33,
   "end": 187.78,
   "text": "List what you really have."
  },
  {
   "start": 188.31,
   "end": 190.37,
   "text": "and the activities change to match."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.22,
   "end": 196.42,
   "text": "The AI has read thousands of lesson plans from schools with smart boards."
  },
  {
   "start": 196.66,
   "end": 198.47,
   "text": "and one tablet for each child."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.0,
   "end": 200.48,
   "text": "So that is what it suggests."
  },
  {
   "start": 200.82,
   "end": 202.12,
   "text": "It is not showing off."
  },
  {
   "start": 202.46,
   "end": 204.13,
   "text": "It simply does not know your room."
  },
  {
   "start": 205.05,
   "end": 207.14,
   "text": "In our plan, the activity says,"
  },
  {
   "start": 207.61,
   "end": 210.05,
   "text": "a tablet quiz and a projector slideshow."
  },
  {
   "start": 210.42,
   "end": 211.68,
   "text": "My school has neither."
  },
  {
   "start": 212.02,
   "end": 213.48,
   "text": "so I add the third line."
  },
  {
   "start": 213.88,
   "end": 216.0,
   "text": "I have only chalk, a board, and paper."
  },
  {
   "start": 216.34,
   "end": 219.97,
   "text": "Now, the activity is pair work with paper strips and chalk."
  },
  {
   "start": 220.44,
   "end": 222.79,
   "text": "Each pair folds a strip into halves."
  },
  {
   "start": 223.1,
   "end": 225.32,
   "text": "then quarters and writes the fraction on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 225.91,
   "end": 226.76,
   "text": "That costs nothing."
  },
  {
   "start": 227.03,
   "end": 228.64,
   "text": "and I can do it tomorrow morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 229.02,
   "end": 230.82,
   "text": "you can list other things as well."
  },
  {
   "start": 231.22,
   "end": 232.87,
   "text": "45 students in the room."
  },
  {
   "start": 233.34,
   "end": 234.76,
   "text": "Benches that do not move."
  },
  {
   "start": 235.29,
   "end": 236.1,
   "text": "No printer."
  },
  {
   "start": 236.47,
   "end": 238.08,
   "text": "Each of these changes the plan."
  },
  {
   "start": 238.49,
   "end": 239.62,
   "text": "with fixed benches."
  },
  {
   "start": 239.96,
   "end": 242.92,
   "text": "It stops asking for circles and group corners."
  },
  {
   "start": 243.22,
   "end": 244.13,
   "text": "with no printer."
  },
  {
   "start": 244.38,
   "end": 246.4,
   "text": "it stops asking for handouts."
  },
  {
   "start": 247.26,
   "end": 249.76,
   "text": "Do not be shy about what your school lacks."
  },
  {
   "start": 250.26,
   "end": 251.65,
   "text": "the AI is not judging."
  },
  {
   "start": 251.99,
   "end": 253.38,
   "text": "the more honest the list."
  },
  {
   "start": 253.72,
   "end": 255.08,
   "text": "the more usable the plan."
  },
  {
   "start": 256.76,
   "end": 257.16,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 257.5,
   "end": 259.52,
   "text": "Three lines for every lesson plan."
  },
  {
   "start": 259.93,
   "end": 261.38,
   "text": "the class and what they know."
  },
  {
   "start": 261.78,
   "end": 262.85,
   "text": "the time you have."
  },
  {
   "start": 263.19,
   "end": 264.16,
   "text": "What is in your room?"
  },
  {
   "start": 264.6,
   "end": 266.08,
   "text": "Our full prompt was"
  },
  {
   "start": 266.39,
   "end": 268.26,
   "text": "Write a lesson plan on fractions."
  },
  {
   "start": 268.57,
   "end": 271.11,
   "text": "It is class 5 first lesson on fraction."
  },
  {
   "start": 271.48,
   "end": 273.16,
   "text": "I have one 40-minute period."
  },
  {
   "start": 273.56,
   "end": 275.68,
   "text": "I have only chalk, a board, and paper."
  },
  {
   "start": 276.06,
   "end": 277.35,
   "text": "Read the draft once."
  },
  {
   "start": 277.72,
   "end": 280.77,
   "text": "Change what does not suit your children and it is ready."
  },
  {
   "start": 281.14,
   "end": 282.37,
   "text": "The AI Drafts"
  },
  {
   "start": 282.71,
   "end": 283.62,
   "text": "You decide."
  }
